  "_title_nl": "Mail: where a search goes",
  "_note_nl": "What you see: Two lanes for a project manager. Left: finding a work package asks OpenProject as you, so you see what you may see there. Right: finding the mail or event of a work package reads the mark on the mail in the mailbox or on the event in the calendar, and one list of links in Nextcloud that knows who linked what. Three facts under the lanes.",
